          "body": "**停止。这是未经请求的自动化推广，本项目不接受。**\n\n@ohalo —— GitHub 账号 `ohalo`，显示名 **halo**，`cybermap.halo26812.eu.org`（cyberMap 导航站）的运营者：\n\n你的账号向大量无关仓库批量发送同一份「排行榜」通知：几分钟内数十条几乎完全相同的内容，每条都带 `cybermap-outreach:v1` 标记，并以通知邮件的形式塞进维护者收件箱——没有人订阅，也无法事先拒收。你仓库里的 `__cybermap_token_probe__` issue 已经说明一切：这是脚本，不是人在沟通。这不是偶发一次——同一脚本已在 GitHub 上持续运行多日，反复消耗本项目维护者的时间、塞满通知收件箱。到此为止。\n\n关于邮件与联系方式：该账号未公开任何邮箱，也未与本项目建立任何订阅关系。所有落进收件箱的「联系」，都是你的脚本开 issue 触发 GitHub 通知邮件（`notifications@github.com`）产生的。要沟通，请使用你自己公开的渠道，不要把我们的 issue 区和收件箱当成你的分发列表。\n\n这些内容与 dsh-context 没有任何关系：不是代码，不是用户，也不是本项目的 issue 区。你页面上的排名不是本项目请求过、同意过或授权过的服务；star 数虽然公开，但这不意味着你有权把我们的 issue 区当作你的分发渠道。\n\n**不要再以任何方式联系本仓库及其维护者**——不要开 issue、不要评论、不要提 PR、不要发邮件。若要把本项目从你的榜单移除，请自行移除；那是你该管理的页面，不是我们该被你填满的收件箱。\n\n本 issue 作为垃圾信息关闭。若继续自动化骚扰，我们将向 GitHub 举报滥用，并保留就反复的未经请求联系及对本项目的干扰追究一切可用救济的全部权利。\n\n---\n\n**Stop. This is unsolicited automated outreach, and it is not welcome here.**\n\n@ohalo — the GitHub account `ohalo`, display name **halo**, operator of `cybermap.halo26812.eu.org` (the cyberMap directory):\n\nYour account posts the same leaderboard notice to unrelated repositories in bulk — dozens of near-identical issues within minutes, each carrying the `cybermap-outreach:v1` marker, each landing in maintainers' inboxes as notification email nobody asked for and nobody can opt out of in advance. The `__cybermap_token_probe__` issues in your own repository make the picture unambiguous: this is scripted, not a person reaching out. This is not a one-off — the same script has been running across GitHub for days, and it has repeatedly consumed this project's maintainer time and filled the notification inbox. It ends here.\n\nOn email and contact details: this account publishes no email address and has no subscription relationship with this project. Every message that reached the inbox was generated by your script opening an issue, which triggered GitHub's own notification email (`notifications@github.com`). If you have something to say, use a channel you publish yourself — not our issue tracker and not our inbox.\n\nNone of this has anything to do with dsh-context — not its code, not its users, not its issue tracker. A ranking on your page is not a service this project requested, agreed to, or consented to. The star count is public, but that does not give you the right to use our issue tracker as your distribution channel.\n\n**Do not contact this repository or its maintainers again** — no issues, no comments, no pull requests, no email. If you want this project removed from your leaderboard, remove it yourself; that is your page to manage, not our inbox to fill.\n\nThis issue is closed as spam. Any further automated contact will be reported to GitHub as abuse, and we reserve all rights to pursue every available remedy against repeated unsolicited contact and interference with this project.\n",
